    "url": "https://rift-ds.com/foundations",
    "title": "/foundations",
    "heading": "/foundations",
    "body": "The shared values behind every component\nFoundations are the colours, spacing, type styles, motion, layout and stacking values that all components are built on. Every value here is a CSS token in the repo, and the Figma kit's variables are named after the same tokens, and components reference tokens rather than hard-coded values. That means updating a colour or spacing value in one place updates it everywhere it is used."
