    "body": "Inputs, pickers, and selection controls for collecting and editing values.\n\n- Checkbox (https://rift-ds.com/components/checkbox): Custom checkbox with check and indeterminate states, keyboard accessible with animated transitions.\n- Colour picker (https://rift-ds.com/components/color-picker): Swatch trigger opening a saturation area, hue and alpha sliders, and a hex field; controlled or uncontrolled.\n- Combobox (https://rift-ds.com/components/combobox): A filterable select that narrows options as the user types, with multi-select chips, grouping, and async loading.\n- Currency input (https://rift-ds.com/components/currency-input): An amount of money as a decimal string, read in the locale's marks and grouped once the field is left.\n- Date input (https://rift-ds.com/components/date-input): Date input with native picker, calendar icon, label, and validation states.\n- Date picker (https://rift-ds.com/components/date-picker): Inline calendar with month navigation, day selection, and today indicator.\n- Date range picker (https://rift-ds.com/components/date-range-picker): An inline calendar for choosing a range of days, one or two months wide, with presets.\n- Dropdown (https://rift-ds.com/components/dropdown): Custom select dropdown with keyboard navigation, disabled options, and error states.\n- Field (https://rift-ds.com/components/field): The shared scaffolding for labelled form controls: label, required marker, helper and error text, and the ARIA wiring that ties them together.\n- File input (https://rift-ds.com/components/file-input): A click-or-drop upload zone paired with a controlled file list showing size, progress, and per-file errors.\n- Filter bar (https://rift-ds.com/components/filter-bar): A row of filter chips for narrowing a collection, each opening a popover of options, with per-filter and clear-all resets.\n- Input (https://rift-ds.com/components/input): Text input with label, placeholder, icons, a prefix or suffix, a clear button, helper text, and error states.\n- Masked input (https://rift-ds.com/components/masked-input): A field that writes its value into a shape as it is typed, with a sensitive mode that hides it.\n- Number input (https://rift-ds.com/components/number-input): Numeric field with increment and decrement steppers and min/max clamping.\n- Pin input (https://rift-ds.com/components/pin-input): Segmented one-time-code input with auto-advance, paste support, and completion callback.\n- Radio button (https://rift-ds.com/components/radio-button): Radio button and radio group with vertical and horizontal layouts, animated dot indicator.\n- Rating (https://rift-ds.com/components/rating): Star-scale rating control with keyboard selection, a read-only mode, and a configurable icon.\n- Rich dropdown (https://rift-ds.com/components/rich-dropdown): Dropdown's rich sibling: options preview their own heading face, body face, and key colour.\n- Signature pad (https://rift-ds.com/components/signature-pad): A signature drawn with a pointer or typed, kept as SVG with a PNG on demand.\n- Slider (https://rift-ds.com/components/slider): Range input for selecting a value between a minimum and maximum, in default and compact sizes.\n- Swatch (https://rift-ds.com/components/swatch): Clickable colour tile for preset palettes and picker triggers, with a theme-aware selection ring.\n- Tag input (https://rift-ds.com/components/tag-input): Multi-value text input with entries held as removable tags.\n- Textarea (https://rift-ds.com/components/textarea): Multi-line text input with character counter, resize control, helper text, and error states.\n- Time picker (https://rift-ds.com/components/time-picker): Time-of-day field with a dropdown list of selectable times.\n- Toggle switch (https://rift-ds.com/components/toggle-switch): Binary on/off toggle control with sliding thumb and check indicator, for settings that take effect immediately."
