    "heading": "1.3.0: InspectorColorPicker and the action colour",
    "body": "InspectorColorPicker joins the Inspector family: the library colour picker dressed as one bar, with its name on the left and the colour on the right. A new motion token, the orbit duration, paces Globe's spin, so a theme's motion scale now reaches it, and Composer can place its context note above the input with contextPlacement=\"above\".\n\nThe action colour is now kept for actions. Spinner, FileInput, Sparkline, the bar charts, Timeline's links, Instructions and DatePicker's today ring each use the role that fits instead, and a build check stops new decorative uses. Every action fill also holds contrast with its label and icon in every state, which repairs the Volt preset, and Treemap labels pick a readable colour for each cell. Nothing breaks, so upgrading needs no code changes.",
